  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the biennium,  ILO support to the labur ferations will focus on the follwing thematic areasation: 
&#x2022; Effective participation in the development of a position paper on the development of National Development Plan (NDP 12).
&#x2022; Strengthen trade union capacity for engagement in the implementation of Botswana Decent Work Country Program.
&#x2022; Launching of the campaign for ratification of C190. 
&#x2022; Lobbying for the ratification of ILO C131, C155 and C187.
&#x2022; Play an active role in the adoption of Climate Change and Just Transition Action Plan at the tripartite.
&#x2022; Engaging in the process of development of a criteria for determining national minimum wage in Botswana.
&#x2022; Strengthening the capacity of the 2 trade union federations for effective leadership and membership service.</narrative>
  </description>
